<script lang="ts">import {formatNaira,parseNairaToMinor} from '$lib/money';let gross=$state('10000');let amount=$derived(Number(parseNairaToMinor(gross)??0n));let fee=$derived(Math.floor(amount*500/10000));</script>
<svelte:head><title>Pricing — WantMyTime</title><meta name="description" content="A proposed simple fee for paid time links." /></svelte:head><section class="article-page"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h1 class="page-heading">Your time. Your price.<br/><em>A small fee when you’re paid.</em></h1><p class="page-intro">No subscription. The proposed fee policy caps total ordinary seller deductions at 5%, including processor costs within that share. This interpretation is awaiting founder and provider approval; live payments remain disabled.</p><div class="calculator"><label>Someone pays<input class="field" bind:value={gross} inputmode="decimal" /></label><div><span>Proposed total deduction</span><strong>{formatNaira(fee)}</strong></div><div><span>Illustrative seller amount</span><strong>{formatNaira(amount-fee)}</strong></div><small>This is illustrative math, not a quote. Provider costs, taxes, limits and eligibility need approval.</small></div><h2>Payment and settlement are different</h2><p>A verified payment can still be awaiting provider settlement. The account should show the actual provider status, not imply that the money is already in a bank account.</p><div class="notice notice-warning">Live collection is disabled until the merchant model, provider account, terms, and fee treatment are approved.</div></section>
